::  mar/gall-watch: subscribe grubbery to a gall agent, materializing
::  facts under /sys/gall/subs. The agent accepts this poke but the
::  desk shipped no mark for it, so a fiber-initiated watch crashed
::  marc-not-found at the gall service.
::
|_  w=[ship=@p dude=@tas pax=path]
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  w
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  ,[ship=@p dude=@tas pax=path]
  --
--
